lSense Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1205970","steamName":"MX vs ATV Legends","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1205970/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:52:18.712952+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider. Become an off-road racing legend in your own right! Your time is now!","detailedDescription":"Just Updated\n\nSeason 5\n\nSeason 5 builds on years of player feedback with highly requested additions that reshape how racing is experienced, shared, and competed online. The brand-new season opens with the Daytona Supercross Track Pack, featuring the 2026 race and 5 throwback versions of Daytona SX through the years, alongside new vehicle packs from top names in the sport. \n\nFree for all players comes another full year of season support! Continued updates bring features like Advanced Replay and Photo Mode, Overhead Map, Time-Based Penalties (replacing instant resets when cutting corners), Server Browser, Cross-Platform Multiplayer, and more additions arriving throughout the season.\n\nAbout the Game\n\nRace your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider.\n\nBecome an off-road racing legend in your own right!\nYour time is now!\n\nFeatures:\n\n• \nRace in 2-player split-screen and 16-player online mode with squad-based gameplay\n\n• \nCompete in the new career mode, where your choices lead to different paths, sponsorship opportunities and special invitational events\n\n• \nExperience the brand new Trails mode for high-intensity outdoor racing, with new surprises around every turn, challenging your riding style in new ways\n\n• \nCustomize your rider and vehicles with the latest parts and gear from the leading manufacturers in off-road racing\n\n• \nRide berms and ruts with higher precision than ever before with the refined physics system.","aboutGame":"Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider.\n\nBecome an off-road racing legend in your own right!\nYour time is now!\n\nFeatures:\n\n• \nRace in 2-player split-screen and 16-player online mode with squad-based gameplay\n\n• \nCompete in the new career mode, where your choices lead to different paths, sponsorship opportunities and special invitational events\n\n• \nExperience the brand new Trails mode for high-intensity outdoor racing, with new surprises around every turn, challenging your riding style in new ways\n\n• \nCustomize your rider and vehicles with the latest parts and gear from the leading manufacturers in off-road racing\n\n• \nRide berms and ruts with higher precision than ever before with the refined physics system."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/95c60ae07c38d7b7a9d8f81fde86e030c7964e14/header.jpg?t=1791298700"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/28733b05683e8e032662bc117a9042388e772759/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791298700"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/d59e0cc2595382699eabde697137